sequenceDiagram
    participant Alice
    participant Bob
    participant John
    Alice->>Bob: Hello Bob, how are you?
    alt is sick
        Bob->>Alice: Not so good :(
    else is well
        Bob->>Alice: Feeling fresh like a daisy
    end
    opt Extra response
        Bob->>Alice: Thanks for asking
    end
    loop Every minute
        John-->Alice: Great!
    end
    par Alice to Bob
        Alice->>Bob: Go help John
    and Alice to John
        Alice->>John: I want this done today
        par John to Charlie
            John->>Charlie: Can we do this today?
        and John to Diana
            John->>Diana: Can you help us today?
        end
    end
    critical Establish a connection to the DB
        Bob-->John: connect
    option Network timeout
        Bob-->Bob: Log error
    end
    break when the booking process fails
        John-->Alice: show failure
    end
    rect rgba(0, 0, 255, .1)
        Alice->>John: highlighted
        rect rgb(200, 150, 255)
            John-->>Alice: nested highlight
        end
    end
